			"notes": "* Initial stable release under Angelic Industries.\n* Replace the FentLib/AngelLib mixin helper dependency with UniMixins' built-in mixin builder. UniMixins 0.1.23 or newer is the only required mod; AngelLib remains optional development QoL.\n* Move Java packages and Maven coordinates to `industries.angelic.vintagepickupnotifier:VintagePickUpNotifier:1.0.0`. Integrations importing the old package must update.\n* Refresh source, issue, download, and Maven links while preserving the original Pick Up Notifier attribution.\n* Update GTNH build conventions to 2.0.34 and the Gradle wrapper to 9.7.1."
